---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import dystopia_logo from '../../assets/dystopia_logo.png';
---

<Layout
	title="Portfolio - Kickbloxers (2020)"
	description="Portfolio - Kickbloxers"
	pubDate={new Date('September 8 2026')}
	/*heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"*/
>
	<p>
		Kickbloxers was a multiplayer puzzle game I worked on at Puny Human in 2020. It featured multiple game modes, 
		including a competitive mode where players would make puzzle matches in order to push the opponents off of 
		the level. It was made on Unreal Engine 4 and was fully networked.
	</p>

	<center>
		<iframe
			width="560"
			height="315"
			src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YIbhFfrnbyQ"
			title="YouTube video"
			frameborder="0"
			allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
			allowfullscreen>
		</iframe>
	</center>

</Layout>
